    <string name="connection_details_title">የግንኙነት ዝርዝሮች</string>
    <string name="connection_details_intro_android">ለመገናኘት የደንበኛ መሣሪያው በዚህ ስልክ ተመሳሳይ መረብ ላይ መሆን አለበት (ተመሳሳይ Wi-Fi ወይም ተመሳሳይ ሆትስፖት / USB tethering)።</string>
    <string name="connection_details_intro_desktop">ለመገናኘት የደንበኛ መሣሪያው በዚህ ኮምፒዩተር ተመሳሳይ መረብ ላይ መሆን አለበት (ተመሳሳይ Wi-Fi ወይም LAN)።</string>
    <string name="connection_details_clients">ማንኛውንም የFTPS ደንበኛ ይጫኑ፣ ለምሳሌ:\n  • Windows: WinSCP, FileZilla\n  • Linux: FileZilla, lftp\n  • macOS: Cyberduck, FileZilla\n  • Android: Ghost Commander\n  • ወይም explicit FTPS የሚደግፍ ሌላ ደንበኛ</string>
    <string name="connection_details_fill_fields">የደንበኛውን መስኮች እንደሚከተለው ይሙሉ።</string>
    <string name="connection_details_host_title">A. HOST</string>
    <string name="connection_details_host_body">Host FTPS Server የሚሄድበት መሣሪያ አድራሻ ነው።\nየIP አድራሻ ይምረጡ። የመሣሪያ ስም መረቡ ሲፈታ ብቻ ይሰራል።\n\nከእነዚህ አንዱን ይጠቀሙ:</string>
    <string name="connection_details_port_title">B. PORT</string>
    <string name="connection_details_port_body">Port በዚያ አስተናጋጅ ላይ የመተግበሪያው ወደብ ነው።</string>
    <string name="connection_details_encryption_title">C. ENCRYPTION</string>
    <string name="connection_details_encryption_body">FTPS Server ትዕዛዞችንና ውሂብን ያመስጥራል።\nየሚደገፈው EXPLICIT TLS (AUTH TLS / FTP over TLS) ብቻ ነው።\n\nበደንበኛው ይምረጡ:\n\n  Protocol: FTP\n  Encryption: Explicit TLS\n    (FileZilla: \"Require explicit FTP over TLS\"\n     WinSCP: \"TLS/SSL Explicit encryption\"\n     Cyberduck: \"FTP-SSL (Explicit AUTH TLS)\")\n\nImplicit FTPS አይምረጡ (ብዙ ጊዜ \"FTPS\" ብቻ ይባላል) — አይገናኝም።</string>
    <string name="connection_details_accounts_title">D. LOGIN and PASSWORD</string>
    <string name="connection_details_accounts_body">የተጋሩ አቃፊዎችን ማግኘት የሚችሉ መለያዎች እነዚህ ናቸው።</string>
    <string name="connection_details_account_format">%1$s. ተጠቃሚ %2$s — ወደ %4$s %3$s መዳረሻ</string>
    <string name="connection_details_login_label">LOGIN:</string>
    <string name="connection_details_password_label">PASSWORD:</string>
    <string name="connection_details_access_read_write">ማንበብ/መጻፍ</string>
    <string name="connection_details_access_read_only">ማንበብ ብቻ</string>
    <string name="connection_details_folder_unspecified">(አቃፊ አልተቀመጠም)</string>
    <string name="connection_details_cert_title">E. CERTIFICATE WARNING</string>
    <string name="connection_details_cert_body">ይህ አገልጋይ በራሱ የተፈረመ የምስክር ወረቀት ይጠቀማል። ደንበኛው ያስጠነቅቃል።\nበደንበኛው ያለውን የጣት አሻራ ከታች ካሉት እሴቶች ጋር ያነፃፅሩ። ከተመሳሰሉ የምስክር ወረቀቱን ይቀበሉ።</string>
    <string name="connection_details_cert_sha256_format">SHA-256:  %1$s</string>
    <string name="connection_details_cert_sha1_format">SHA-1:    %1$s</string>
    <string name="connection_details_cert_fingerprint_hint">ደንበኛው \"Fingerprint\" ብቻ ካሳየ (ያለ የአልጎሪዝም ስም) መጀመሪያ SHA-256 ከዚያ SHA-1 ጋር ያነፃፅሩ።</string>
